renderdoc (1.45+qt6-0ppa1~resolute1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Rebase Qt6 migration branch onto upstream v1.45.
  * Drop libpcre3-dev build-dependency: no longer packaged on 26.04/resolute.
  * Vendor pcre 8.45 (like swig) so the build farm doesn't need network
    access when the system pcre header is missing.
  * Fix autotools timestamp issue that broke the vendored pcre build with
    automake/aclocal versions newer than pcre 8.45 was packaged with.
  * Fix Qt6 ambiguous operator+= build error in D3D12PipelineStateViewer.

 -- Sergey Kovrov <kovrov@gmail.com>  Sat, 04 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000

